+AnimatLab lets a researcher draw and inspect these connections. In SNS-Toolbox, researchers specify them in Python and can render the resulting network \citep{cofer_animatlab_2010,nourse_sns_2023}. I developed SNS-Simscape so a researcher could construct a circuit graphically in Simulink while retaining scripts to generate repeated connections and test parameter sets. Table~\ref{tab:sns_capability} identifies the tools for preparing a body, building its controller, and repeating an experiment.
 
